/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
45 780 Td
(   works \(ETPs/STPs\), monitors sewage and trade effluent discharges, and enforces compliance with) Tj
T*
(   environmental standards.) Tj
T*
(   3. The Dual 'Consent' Regulatory Regime:) Tj
T*
(   Under Section 25, no person or corporate enterprise can establish or operate any industrial) Tj
T*
(   plant, operation, or disposal system likely to discharge sewage or trade effluent without prior) Tj
T*
(   statutory consent from the SPCB:) Tj
T*
(   - 1. Consent to Establish \(CTE / NOC\):) Tj
T*
(   * Obtained BEFORE initiating site ground construction, structural engineering, or machinery) Tj
T*
(   installation.) Tj
T*
(   * Evaluates site suitability, proximity to water bodies, and the engineering adequacy of) Tj
T*
(   proposed effluent treatment plants \(ETPs\).) Tj
T*
(   - 2. Consent to Operate \(CTO\):) Tj
T*
(   * Obtained AFTER constructing ETP facilities but BEFORE commissioning commercial production.) Tj
T*
(   * Prescribes quantitative effluent discharge standards \(pH, TSS, BOD, COD, heavy metals\) and) Tj
T*
(   requires installation of Continuous Online Effluent Monitoring Systems \(OCEMS\). CTO must be) Tj
T*
(   renewed periodically.) Tj
T*
(   4. Coercive Enforcement Powers:) Tj
T*
(   - Power of Entry and Inspection \(Section 23\): Authorized officers have unrestricted right to) Tj
T*
(   enter any industrial facility to inspect systems and take wastewater samples \(Section 21\)) Tj
T*
(   following strict legal sampling protocols admissible in judicial courts.) Tj
T*
(   - Power to Issue Binding Directions \(Section 33A\):) Tj
T*
(   Empowers the SPCB to issue binding written directions to any person, officer, or authority,) Tj
T*
(   including:) Tj
T*
(   * The immediate closure, prohibition, or regulation of any industrial operation or process.) Tj
T*
(   * The stoppage or regulation of electricity, water, or other municipal utility services to) Tj
T*
(   defaulting units.) Tj
T*
(   - Criminal Penalties \(Sections 41 to 44\): Operating without consent or violating discharge) Tj
T*
(   standards carries mandatory imprisonment of 1.5 to 6 years and substantial monetary fines.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
