(   chimney stacks, and adherence to National Ambient Air Quality Standards \(NAAQS\) and) Tj
T*
(   point-source emission limits.) Tj
T*
(   4. The 1987 Statutory Amendment: Inclusion of Noise Pollution:) Tj
T*
(   - Section 2\(a\) was formally amended in 1987 to expand the legal definition of 'air pollutant') Tj
T*
(   to include: 'any solid, liquid or gaseous substance including noise present in the atmosphere) Tj
T*
(   in such concentration as may be or tend to be injurious to human beings or other living) Tj
T*
(   creatures or plants or property.') Tj
T*
(   - Enabled the enactment of the Noise Pollution \(Regulation and Control\) Rules, 2000,) Tj
T*
(   establishing ambient day and night decibel standards across Industrial, Commercial,) Tj
