T*
(   Under Paragraph 7\(i\) III of the EIA Notification 2006, the public hearing component is) Tj
T*
(   explicitly exempted for:) Tj
T*
(   - Projects located within officially notified industrial estates or export processing zones) Tj
T*
(   where the estate itself has undergone prior environmental clearance.) Tj
T*
(   - All Category B2 projects.) Tj
T*
(   - Highway expansion projects that do not involve land acquisition.) Tj
T*
