T*
(   away \(undrained conditions\).) Tj
T*
(   * Pore water is compressed, causing excess pore water pressure \(Delta u\) to escalate rapidly.) Tj
T*
(   * When excess pore water pressure equals total overburden stress \(u = sigma_total\):) Tj
T*
