T*
(   4. Ground Improvement Mitigation Engineering:) Tj
T*
(   - Vibro-Compaction and Stone Columns: Inserting large vibrating poker probes into loose sand) Tj
T*
(   deposits, combined with water/air jets and gravel backfill. Vibrations densify sand relative) Tj
T*
(   density from Dr < 40% to Dr > 80%, eliminating contractive volume collapse.) Tj
T*
(   - Geotechnical Drainage: Installing vertical earthquake drains \(prefabricated perforated) Tj
T*
