(   2. Systemic Cyanide Toxicity Hypothesis:) Tj
T*
(   Thermal decomposition of MIC inside Tank 610 produced hydrogen cyanide \(HCN\). Post-mortem) Tj
T*
(   examinations by toxicologists revealed cherry-red venous blood and elevated rhodanese enzyme) Tj
T*
(   activity, and administration of sodium thiosulfate \(Na2S2O3, an antidote facilitating cyanide) Tj
T*
(   conversion to thiocyanate\) produced clinical improvements in early survivors.) Tj
T*
(   3. Chronic Long-Term Clinical Pathologies:) Tj
T*
(   - Respiratory: Severe persistent Pulmonary Fibrosis, Chronic Obstructive Pulmonary Disease) Tj
T*
(   \(COPD\), restrictive lung disease, and chronic bronchiolitis obliterans.) Tj
T*
(   - Immunological: Chronic immune suppression, elevated circulating autoantibodies, and) Tj
T*
(   destruction of cellular immunity.) Tj
T*
(   - Neurological: Memory loss, sleep disturbances, peripheral neuropathy, and severe chronic) Tj
T*
(   depression.) Tj
T*
(   4. Genetic and Teratogenic Damage:) Tj
T*
(   - High rates of spontaneous miscarriages \(spontaneous abortion rate exceeded 43% in pregnant) Tj
T*
(   women exposed during the tragedy\).) Tj
T*
(   - Chromosomal Aberrations: Cytogenetic studies revealed chromosomal breaks, sister chromatid) Tj
T*
(   exchanges \(SCE\), and translocations in peripheral blood lymphocytes that persisted for decades.) Tj
T*
(   - Congenital Deformities: Elevated incidence of congenital neural tube defects, musculoskeletal) Tj
T*
(   deformities, and congenital heart disease in children born to exposed mothers.) Tj
T*
