(   inflation, agrarian distress, farmer suicides, and mass rural distress migration.) Tj
T*
(   3. Engineering and Watershed Mitigation Strategies:) Tj
T*
(   - Micro-Irrigation Systems: Drip and sprinkler irrigation achieve water application) Tj
T*
(   efficiencies exceeding 90% \(compared to 30-40% for flood irrigation\), delivering water directly) Tj
T*
(   to root zones.) Tj
T*
(   - Integrated Watershed Development: Constructing check dams, continuous contour trenches) Tj
T*
(   \(CCTs\), percolation ponds, and gabion structures across micro-catchments to intercept monsoon) Tj
T*
(   runoff and recharge groundwater aquifers.) Tj
T*
(   - Drought-Tolerant Crops: Promoting climate-resilient coarse grains and millets \(Sorghum, Pearl) Tj
T*
(   Millet, Finger Millet\) with high water-use efficiency.) Tj
